      "content": "The Sound Transit OneBusAway API provides access to real-time and scheduled transit data for the Puget Sound region including routes, stops, arrivals, departures, and vehicle positions. Supports real-time data for the 1 Line, 2 Line, T Line, and ST Express bus routes.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Sound Transit Open Transit Data\n Email: open_transit_data@soundtransit.org",
